# Query 4: Multi-document portfolio analysis
# Highlights: aggregation across all 4 portfolio companies

Output recordings/04_portfolio_risks.mp4

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "cd /home/axel-oeberg/pvk/quantera && source venv/bin/activate && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type `make query Q="What are the main financial risks across our portfolio based on the latest reports?"`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 25s
